Big Fish was the first of Noah's characters among [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. He died in [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/index|the Leviathan]] at the Night Market, in a fight between Oresk's [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]], the Feep-blessed [[People/Althane/Rowan|Rowan]] and the Weft: Rowan exploded, vaporising Big Fish entirely and throwing the rest of the party into a branch reality. There they found [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]], Big Fish's alternate-reality self.
